  "executionSequence": [
    "Verify every declared input/source/runtime binding; use new private exclusive run root. Any mismatch stops execution.",
    "Use all 80 children and the frozen 3066 selected tokens. Keep seven post-cap unsupported tokens as explicit unavailable/failed rows; no replacements or new exclusions.",
    "Use fixed occurrence extraction, unchanged retained p0+p1, preserved full-DEV candidate and saved fixed calibration only; no fit, threshold selection or parameter changes.",
    "Save all three arms terminal states for every selected token. Create private canonical prediction lock and retain its SHA externally BEFORE any reserved outcome join.",
